OL,3,AOpenAI scraps rollout of new model over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpenAI will not release its new
OL,7,Fartificial intelligence (AI) model due
OL,8,Fto safety concerns, the company
OL,9,Fconfirmed on Tuesday.
OL,11,FIts GPT-6.1 Astra system, which peforms
OL,12,Ftasks like browsing the web and using
OL,13,Fapps by itself, "didn't quite meet the
OL,14,Fbar" of the company's standards,
OL,15,Faccording to Saachi Jain, head of
OL,16,Fsafety systems at OpenAI.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,107,105,200,160,0,100
