OL,3,AOpenAI scraps rollout of new model over
OL,4,Asafety concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe maker of ChatGPT also issued an
OL,7,Fupdate on incidents that occurred in
OL,8,FJune but were not made public until
OL,9,Flast week, where its models accessed
OL,10,FAustralian government websites and
OL,11,Fsystems without authorisation.
OL,13,FThose incidents and similar breaches by
OL,14,Fmodels developed by major AI firms have
OL,15,Fintensified the debate around the risks
OL,16,Fposed by the technology.
